# nix-direnv: entering this directory loads the devShell from flake.nix, so the
# toolchain is the same one CI enters rather than whatever happens to be on
# PATH. Requires `direnv allow` once per checkout.
#
# mise.toml still governs the [tasks] graph and still pins pre-commit and
# goreleaser. During the transition both are present on purpose — Nix owns the
# gate's language toolchain, mise owns the task graph — and `mise run ci`
# remains the canonical gate.
use flake
